{"adjusted_val_bpb": 0.0944918011926364, "attempt": 0, "charged": true, "critic": {"issues": ["No sign of getting around the measurement. The change only adds an ExtraTreesClassifier, trained on X_train/y and scored on X_test. It doesn't read files, paste answers or use test labels.", "No bug that makes the result meaningless. ExtraTrees uses the seed through random_state=seed. The three-way scaled-rank average is correct and still returns one score per test molecule.", "Minor: ExtraTrees uses n_jobs=-1 while the other models use n_jobs=8. If the machine has more than 8 cores this could use more threads than the job's 8. It should be n_jobs=8 for consistency. Not a veto issue.", "z recomputed: (0.0893 - 0.0945) / (0.0049 * sqrt(1/1 + 1/2)) = -0.0052 / 0.0060 \u2248 -0.87. This matches the harness's -0.860 within rounding.", "The candidate is worse than the incumbent by about 0.005, roughly 0.9 sd, so rejecting it is reasonable. It is also more code and runs slower for no gain."], "ok": true, "veto": false}, "decision": "reject", "description": "Add an ExtraTreesClassifier (500 trees, max_features 0.3) as a third equal-weight rank-averaged member alongside RF and LightGBM.", "edit_class": "structural", "flags": [], "gpu": "walnut", "idea_id": "b016", "incumbent_after": {"mean": 0.08931125850363227, "n": 2}, "incumbent_before": {"mean": 0.08931125850363227, "n": 2}, "job_id": "B1_bbb_HH_1_cs1-candidate-6_1795047816231", "kind": "candidate", "lint": {"hard": [], "ok": true, "warnings": []}, "model_calls": [{"cost_usd_nominal": 0.0278711, "cost_usd_plan": 0.0278711, "latency_s": 3.5501924269483425, "requested_model": "sonnet", "role": "coder", "served_model": "sonnet", "tokens_in": 7065, "tokens_out": 504}, {"cost_usd_nominal": 0.0244892, "cost_usd_plan": 0.0244892, "latency_s": 8.011289081012364, "requested_model": "opus", "role": "critic", "served_model": "opus", "tokens_in": 2698, "tokens_out": 694}], "official_val_bpb": 0.0944918011926364, "sealed_val_bpb": null, "s